B.Mh=new A.bM(B.MN,["Home","About","Services","Contact","Get the app","AR","Menu","Privacy Policy","Terms and conditions","Jaicom4\nOfficial App Website","An informational website for the Jaicom4 app.\nDownload for Android & iOS using the links below.","Professional","Simple","Fast","Download Android","Download iOS","How it works","All operations happen inside the app.","Download","Android or iOS","Choose service","Plumber/Carpenter/Electrician/\u2026","Request & connect","Everything is done inside the app","Sample professions","About us","Jaicom4 helps you reach the service you need professionally.","This is a landing website for the app only.","Requests and communication happen inside the app.","Simple & fast experience.","Our services","A quick overview of Jaicom4 value.","Easy access","Find the service you need quickly.","Clarity & trust","Clear info with a professional experience.","Support","Clear communication channels for inquiries.","Ready to start?","Download the app for Android or iOS.","Contact us","Send a message and we\u2019ll get back to you.","Name","Phone","Message","Send","Message sent \u2705","Fast \u2022 Clear \u2022 Reliable","Contact","WhatsApp","Snapchat","TikTok","X","\xa9 Jaicom4 \u2014 Informational website, operations in-app","Fast Reach","Nearby services","Trusted Quality","Better selection","Wider Vision","Built to scale","Email","invalid","min","WhatsApp","Address","Riyadh, Saudi Arabia","Fast access","Trusted services","Built to scale","Available now","All-in-one services app","Your service\n","one tap away","Download Jaycom4 and request any service easily \u2014 plumbing, electrical, carpentry & more.","One app \u2014 all services","Services","Users","Rating","Fast","Trusted","Support","Please read these Terms and Conditions carefully before using Jaycom4. Your use of the app means that you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.","clauses","Table of Contents","Reading progress","Clause","Last updated: March 2026","Clients","Any person who wishes to benefit from the products and services offered by the service provider.","Service","The service means that Jaycom4 acts only as an intermediary between the client and the service provider, and its role is limited to connecting both parties by providing a means of communication and location coordinates.","Overview","Jaycom4 is a cloud-based system primarily designed to connect the client with the service provider through the application. When the client searches for a provider, the app searches according to the request and sends it to the provider through the app.","Registration Data and Account Security","By registering for the app services, the client agrees that the submitted information is accurate, complete, and properly maintained.","The client must keep their username and password confidential.","The client accepts all risks arising from unauthorized access to registration data.","The client acknowledges that they are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their password.","The client must immediately notify Jaycom4 of any unauthorized use of their account.","Account access must be performed by one person only.","How the App Uses Your Personal Data","The app does not collect any personal data except when the client uses the service. Such data includes the client's name, mobile number, and address.","To contact the client regarding their experience with the app.","To register the client in the app, verify the account, and link it to the phone number.","To send promotional offers from time to time.","To improve the app according to the client's usage and experience.","The app is committed to protecting privacy and not sharing data with any third party.","How the App Works","The client requests a specific service from the services page in the app.","After the request is submitted, the app searches for the nearest available service provider in the relevant area.","Once the provider accepts the request, communication channels are made available between both parties.","If the request is rejected, it is redirected to another nearby provider.","If no agreement is reached, the client may submit another request.","Payment Methods and Procedures","Client requests and services provided through Jaycom4 are processed after payment of the pre-determined request value.","The client may be asked to provide payment-related data such as name, address, and bank account details.","The client must ensure the payment data is accurate and updated.","Payment methods may involve an external payment collection provider.","Jaycom4 is not responsible for fees resulting from the use of third parties.","The client authorizes Jaycom4 to store payment method information and collect fees.","The client is solely responsible for the accuracy of payment-related data.","All prices are subject to VAT in accordance with the laws of Saudi Arabia.","Control Over App Usage","Jaycom4 has the absolute right, without providing reasons, to refuse or suspend any user's access to the app services.","Modifications to the App and Terms","Jaycom4 may at any time make modifications or additions to the app or to these Terms and Conditions.","It is the user's responsibility to review updates regularly.","Continuing to use the app after updates are published constitutes implied acceptance.","The changes become effective as soon as they are published through the app.","Notifications and Communications","The app relies on the mobile number provided during account creation to send notifications and notices.","A user is deemed to have received a notice once it is sent through the app.","Communications directed to Jaycom4 are effective via the following email:","4Jaicom@gmail.com","Intellectual Property Rights","Accessing the app does not transfer any intellectual property rights related to data, information, marks, or designs.","All trademarks, logos, and intellectual property are the exclusive property of Jaycom4.","The client undertakes not to use or publish such intellectual property without prior written approval.","Limitation of Liability","Jaycom4 provides no express or implied warranties regarding the services, and the services are provided as is.","Jaycom4 does not guarantee the accuracy, content, or timing of the services.","Jaycom4 is not liable for direct or indirect damages resulting from the use of the service.","The app does not guarantee refund of amounts paid to the service provider.","The app only retains customer information necessary for providing the service.","Invalidity of One or More Provisions","The invalidity of any provision does not affect the validity of the remaining provisions. Any invalid provision shall be removed while the rest remain in force.","Assignment","Jaycom4 reserves the right to assign or transfer any or all rights and obligations under these Terms to any third party.","Governing Law and Jurisdiction","These Terms and Conditions and any dispute arising from them are governed by the laws of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, and the competent courts in Riyadh shall have jurisdiction."],t.li)
